    "semiology_text": {
      "value": ". She has reported approximately five events per week. Her seizures have shown response to Keppra (levetiracetam), though the ongoing frequency and multiple prior medication trials remain concerning for likely drug-resistant focal epilepsy. Prior antiseizure medication trials include Tegretol (carbamazepine) and Briviact (brivaracetam), both stopped because of mood side effects;",
